## Reading
Both engines admit resub-1/2 on the ~160 ms stagger, then hold resub-3 until
resub-0 completes (queue wait equals resub-0's total lifetime to the millisecond,
in both runs). The dc622216 re-arm (fork-settlement rescue) does not change this
scenario: the 4th-replay hold is present on the fixed engine too. This is a
different admission situation from the serve repro, where replays are submitted
while the original requests are still running.
